---
title: Job Retry Lifecycle
---
flowchart TD
    A([Job Created]) --> B[Worker picks up job]
    B --> C[Attempt processing]
    C --> D{Result}

    D -->|Success| E([Job Complete])

    D -->|Retriable failure\n503, timeout, rate limit| F{Retry count\n< max attempts?}
    F -->|Yes| G["Backoff delay\n2^attempt + jitter seconds"]
    G --> B

    F -->|No| H[(Dead Letter Queue)]

    D -->|Non-retriable failure\n401, 400, schema error| I{Log and classify}
    I --> H

    H --> J[Alert fires]
    J --> K[Human review]
    K --> L{Root cause\nresolved?}
    L -->|No| M[Investigate]
    M --> L
    L -->|Yes| N[Replay endpoint]
    N -->|re-enqueue| B

    style H fill:#3d1a1a,stroke:#e05c5c,color:#f0f0f0
    style E fill:#1a3d1a,stroke:#3dba72,color:#f0f0f0
    style J fill:#3d2a1a,stroke:#f0814a,color:#f0f0f0
